profile:
Russian Metal act presents heavy metal guitar riffs with evolving melodies and female vocals.

The band includes:
• Anton Mityugin - composer, bass guitarist;
• Aleksandr Sidelin - the author of music and lyrics, guitars;
• Miroslava Mirova-keyboards;
• Anton Zaitsev - drums;
• And Maya Gitsina, whose sensual vocals permeate all the compositions of the band
